    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνηστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνάομαι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wooed and won, wedded</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλοχοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.246
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.36
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνηστή</span>, abs., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.780
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>memorable, to be remembered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					6138
				</span></i>
			.</div>
